bottled-forgejo — Cloud in a Bottle packaging of the Forgejo code forge.

Upstream project: Forgejo
URL: https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo
License: GPL-3.0-or-later (SPDX: GPL-3.0-or-later)

Source offer: The complete corresponding source for Forgejo is available at
the upstream repository above. The Dockerfile in this repo pins or references
the upstream release used in the container image.

Third-party components in this repository:
- auth_proxy.py — lightweight HTTP reverse-proxy (Python) for Cloud in a Bottle SSO

